      "comment": "BAILEY DUTTON (1) is a well performed sprinter ideally suited at the shorter trips. Kept coming to finish fourth over 350m at this track (20.36) latest in a Grade 5. Form at the trip strong including one wins. Can atone. LITTLE KAOS (2) flew the lids from the middle with a slick turn of foot before finishing second (17.74) and beaten 3 lengths over 300m at Taree Super Track. Leading chance. JAY SANDS (5) turned in a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 350m behind Pretentious (20.51) in a Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. Likely to be thereabouts. GOOD ODDS CUBA (7) took up a forward position and go the job done last time out. Right in the mix.",
